description:
Implement a `PubSub` class with wildcard topic support.

- `subscribe(topic, fn)` — registers `fn` to receive messages on `topic`
- `publish(topic, data)` — calls all listeners on `topic`; also calls all listeners on the special wildcard topic `'*'`
- `unsubscribe(topic, fn)` — removes `fn` from `topic`

**Example:**
```js
const bus = new PubSub();
const log = [];
bus.subscribe('user.login', d => log.push(d));
bus.subscribe('*', d => log.push('wildcard:' + d));
bus.publish('user.login', 'alice');
// log: ['alice', 'wildcard:alice']
bus.unsubscribe('user.login', handler);
```

